+| 1 | Vendor 9 drivers + setup.py from rig working tree | **PASS** | scp'd 2026-06-09 from `dgg-vti:~/Documents/GitHub/vti_drivers/` (HEAD 5859dad, working tree newer — see `src/vti_drivers/README.md` for per-file provenance). |
+| 2 | `vti_drivers` exposed as package | **PASS** | Added to `[tool.hatch.build.targets.wheel] packages` in pyproject.toml. `uv run python -c "import vti_drivers"` OK; all 9 modules import clean. |
+| 3 | `lib/measureme` submodule init + `uv sync` | **PASS** | measureme at 134fd49 (sharpelab). NOTE: `lib/measurebot` submodule was also uninitialized in this worktree; populated by plain file copy from the main checkout (same pinned SHA 8a6ecb4, no git command run). |
